<title>UK: Bass firms after Kleinwort upgrade.</title>
<headline>Bass firms after Kleinwort upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bass Plc edged higher against the declining trend of the market overall on Monday after analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson raised to stock to &quot;add&quot; from &quot;hold,&quot; dealers said.</p>
<p>Bass shares were up 3p at 837-1/2 by 1340 GMT in modest trade of just 813,772 shares, extending a rebound since they touched a year's low of 715p on June 25.</p>
<p>Analysts at Kleinwort were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
